      "text": "Help me choose: explain the remaining questions in plain language. Keep my original task and the details I already provided.\nMy answers so far:\nPlan name: Vector Scale\nDescription: An AI workspace for growing teams. Includes 40 seats, unlimited projects, 100,000 monthly AI credits, and priority support.\nPrice: 249\nCurrency: USD",
